{
  "title": "Canada, rebuilt as one story: Maple's Team",
  "checkIn": "ship (a salvage, built in one go at your request)",
  "kaylee": "Maple the beaver has no hockey team. She flies across Canada, plays six games to bring six friends home, then plays the geese for the Maple Cup and wins the trophy.",
  "questions": [
    "Merging puts Canada back on her map (it was hidden). Put it back now, or keep it hidden until she has playtested it?",
    "The friends' names are my picks: Monty the moose, Roxy the raccoon, Tuque the snowman, Lulu the loon, Misty the spirit bear, Ollie the otter, Gus the goose. Keep them?",
    "In the big game the geese can now score a goal (she still always wins in the end). Right for her, or should the geese never score?"
  ],
